{"availability":"available","full":"wasifibnharun/querybridge-ai","name":"querybridge-ai","description":"Full-stack RAG platform that turns Google Drive knowledge into AI-powered answers using React, n8n, Pinecone, OpenAI, Gmail, and Google Sheets.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T09:25:22Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:27:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://querybridge-ai.vercel.app","topics":["ai-automation","full-stack","n8n","openai","openai-api","pinecone","rag","react","typesrcipt","vercel"],"demo":"https://querybridge-ai.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.090Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.090Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.090Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.090Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Document-grounded answers from a secure submission form to your inbox.","Live application · Architecture · Setup · Deployment","QueryBridge AI is a full-stack question-answering platform. A responsive React form accepts a visitor's contact details and question; a Vercel Function validates and forwards the request to an authenticated n8n webhook. n8n retrieves relevant Google Drive knowledge from Pinecone, asks OpenAI for a grounded response, sends user and administrator email through Gmail, and records the outcome in Google Sheets. The live website's primary production happy path was manually verified on October 9, 2026."],"features":["Same-origin React → Express/Vercel API with shared Zod validation and server-only webhook credentials.","Authenticated n8n webhook that returns HTTP 202 acceptance before asynchronous RAG processing.","Native Pinecone Vector Store and OpenAI nodes, not a generic AI Agent or hand-built search endpoint.","Google Drive ingestion with source-aware chunks and explicit text-embedding-3-small embeddings.","Top-five Pineco